BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:f178a423cf188b7d4f0f67f8
SUMMARY:Mutual Dance Theatre in Up-Close '26
DTSTAMP:20260910T080355Z
DTSTART:20261204T003000Z
DESCRIPTION:Surround yourself in an enrapturing modern dance experience Up-
	Close is Mutual Dance Theatre's own resident company\, performing in the r
	ound\, inches from the audience. Every seat is a front-row seat\, and past
	 audiences describe it as immersive\, immediate\, and unforgettable. An au
	dience favorite and quickly sold-out every year\, Up-Close is not your typ
	ical dance performance. In the converted rehearsal studio\, audience membe
	rs can feel the movement through the floor\, hear the breaths\, and be par
	t of the action of new experimental\, long-form works. This year's program
	 restages Steven P. Evans's |S|P|A|C|E| which features a floor-to-ceiling 
	curtain of translucent plastic that divides the room — and the audience — 
	in two. Made during the isolation of 2020\, |S|P|A|C|E| poses questions ab
	out distance\, misunderstanding\, and the ways we mask and separate from o
	ne another. In a season built around what we inherit and what persists\, t
	his look back lands with resonance. The program also includes an exciting 
	new work by Countess V. Winfrey\, newly appointed associate artistic direc
	tor for her 14th season with Dayton Contemporary Dance Company. Back for a
	 second commission in this unique format\, Winfrey's first Up-Close Work (
	Somewhere\, They Freed Themselves) was described by an audience as her opu
	s. Winfrey's new piece arrives at the height of her career. Tickets are li
	mited: this is the only chance all season to see Mutual Dance Theatre's re
	sident company this close\, breath and step within reach! For more informa
	tion\, visit mutualdance.org ADDITIONAL EVENTS: Saturday\, December 5\, 20
	26: Learn portions of Winfrey's new work in a repertory masterclass in the
	 actual performance space. Saturday\, December 12\, 2026: American Sign La
	nguage interpretation provided at the performance. THIS PERFORMANCE DOES N
	OT TAKE PLACE AT THE ARONOFF. IT TAKES PLACE AT MUTUAL ARTS HARTWELL STUDI
	O: 8222 MONON AVE\, CINCINNATI\, OH 45216.\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.o
	rg/events/detail/mutual-dance-theatre-in-up-close-26
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/mutual-dance-theatre-in-up
	-close-26
LOCATION:Mutual Arts Center Hartwell Studio\, 8222 Monon Ave\, Cin\, OH 452
	16\, Mutual Arts Center Hartwell
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Dance
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
