BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:86228ae0200442b8aee97dce
SUMMARY:David Choate's Hot Chocolate 2026
DTSTAMP:20260910T080355Z
DTSTART:20261205T010000Z
DESCRIPTION:The holiday tradition Cincinnati has embraced is back! Now in i
	ts 6th spectacular year\, David Choate's Hot Chocolate: An African America
	n Nutcracker returns to the Aronoff Center\, and rumor has it this year is
	 "hotter" than ever! Hot Chocolate is a fresh production filled with breat
	htaking dance\, unforgettable music\, dazzling visuals\, and the warmth of
	 family\, culture\, and community. Inspired by the timeless magic of The N
	utcracker\, Hot Chocolate reimagines the classic through the richness of t
	he African American experience\, blending ballet with contemporary\, jazz\
	, modern\, hip-hop\, African diasporic movement\, and powerful storytellin
	g. Whether you're discovering Hot Chocolate for the first time or returnin
	g to make it part of your family's holiday tradition\, 2026 promises to be
	 the biggest\, boldest\, and most magical production yet! Experience the m
	agic. Feel the warmth. Start a new holiday tradition.\n\nhttps://www.cinci
	nnatiarts.org/events/detail/david-choates-hot-chocolate-2026
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/david-choates-hot-chocolat
	e-2026
LOCATION:Jarson-Kaplan Theater\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Dance
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3497e149a4a9d1234bc406a2
SUMMARY:David Choate's Hot Chocolate 2026
DTSTAMP:20260910T080355Z
DTSTART:20261205T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:The holiday tradition Cincinnati has embraced is back! Now in i
	ts 6th spectacular year\, David Choate's Hot Chocolate: An African America
	n Nutcracker returns to the Aronoff Center\, and rumor has it this year is
	 "hotter" than ever! Hot Chocolate is a fresh production filled with breat
	htaking dance\, unforgettable music\, dazzling visuals\, and the warmth of
	 family\, culture\, and community. Inspired by the timeless magic of The N
	utcracker\, Hot Chocolate reimagines the classic through the richness of t
	he African American experience\, blending ballet with contemporary\, jazz\
	, modern\, hip-hop\, African diasporic movement\, and powerful storytellin
	g. Whether you're discovering Hot Chocolate for the first time or returnin
	g to make it part of your family's holiday tradition\, 2026 promises to be
	 the biggest\, boldest\, and most magical production yet! Experience the m
	agic. Feel the warmth. Start a new holiday tradition.\n\nhttps://www.cinci
	nnatiarts.org/events/detail/david-choates-hot-chocolate-2026
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/david-choates-hot-chocolat
	e-2026
LOCATION:Jarson-Kaplan Theater\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Dance
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
