BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:388f3d9f7c8c051e03681938
SUMMARY:Mutual Dance Theatre presents Boca Tuya of NYC
DTSTAMP:20260910T080355Z
DTSTART:20270227T003000Z
DESCRIPTION:Mutual Dance Theatre and the Jefferson James Contemporary Dance
	 Theater Series present Boca Tuya of New York City "FULL OF SENSUAL VULNER
	ABILITY\, HYPNOTIC" — FJORD PRICES Starting at $29. $5 Early Bird Discount
	 for tickets purchased by January 31st\, 2027. Seniors/Students discounts 
	available with valid ID at box office at 650 Walnut St. Boca Tuya: A cutti
	ng-edge and “chillingly beautiful” powerhouse In another exciting Cincinna
	ti debut\, Mutual Dance Theatre brings the quickly-rising\, scintillating 
	Boca Tuya from New York City to the Aronoff. Founder/choreographer Omar Ro
	mán de Jesús is highly sought-after\, having amassed over 20 commissions f
	rom companies like Paul Taylor Dance Company\, Ballet Hispánico\, Pittsbur
	gh Ballet\, Charlotte Ballet\, and The Juilliard School. Boca Tuya is a co
	llection of the best-of-the-best Contemporary dancers from the major leagu
	es\, coming together from Ailey II\, Parsons Dance\, Backahusdans\, Yue Yi
	n Dance Company (part of Mutual's 25-26 season)\, and Ballet Hispánico (pa
	rt of Mutual's 22-23 season). de Jesús' choreography combines his own Puer
	to Rican heritage with classical and contemporary dance in ways that are c
	inematic\, "finely tuned" and "masterful" (The Dance Enthusiast). Boca Tuy
	a's program considers Mutual's Heritage\, Unfolding: A Season of Histories
	 and America250 themes from a gorgeous and cinematic American\, Puerto Ric
	an lens. PARENTAL ADVISORY: This production includes non-sexual artistic n
	udity (visible breasts under a mesh top). Parents and guardians are encour
	aged to use their discretion when deciding if the performance is appropria
	te for younger viewers. For more information\, visit mutualdance.org/bocat
	uya. ADDITIONAL EVENTS: Friday\, February 26\, 2027: Post-show Q&A. Saturd
	ay\, February 26\, 2027: Off-site masterclass with Omar Román de Jesús. Sa
	turday\, February 27\, 2027\, 7pm: Pre-show interview with the Artistic Di
	rector Omar Román de Jesús hosted by Mutual Dance Theatre's Jeanne Mam-Luf
	t. Saturday\, February 27\, 2027: Americ\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.org
	/events/detail/mutual-dance-theatre-presents-boca-tuya-of-nyc
URL:https://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/mutual-dance-theatre-prese
	nts-boca-tuya-of-nyc
LOCATION:Jarson-Kaplan Theater\, Aronoff Center
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Dance
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
