DESCRIPTION:Performance Times April 9\, 2027 6:30PM April 10\, 2027 11:00AM
	 April 10\, 2027 2:30PM April 10\, 2027 6:30PM April 11\, 2027 2:30PM Adap
	ted from the fairy tale classic\, this charming production is designed to 
	delight audiences of all ages. It features familiar characters\, including
	 the evil witch who tempts the children to her cottage with beautifully de
	corated treats. This one-hour ballet brings the beloved story to life for 
	all ages and features the Second Company\, CB2\, alongside students from t
	he Cincinnati Otto M. Budig Academy in this regional premiere at the Arono
	ff Center for the Arts. Info & Ordering Cincinnati Ballet Box Office 513-6
	21-5282 1801 Gilbert Avenue | Cincinnati\, OH 45202 Additional Info and Ho
	urs\n\nhttps://www.cincinnatiarts.org/events/detail/ballet-hansel-gretel-2
	7
